menu "Node health"

    config NODE_HEALTH_DEBUG_HANG
        bool "Hang the health AO 15 s after boot (debug)"
        default n
        help
            For testing the task watchdog only. 15 s after boot the health
            AO's dispatch never returns, so its thread stops feeding the
            task watchdog, which resets the node; the next boot logs
            reset_reason=task_wdt. Never enable it in sdkconfig.defaults or
            sdkconfig.qemu.

endmenu
